@format 1
@id queue.create-merge-work
@title Create merge work
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Convert the Merge tab's current groups into durable work while preserving output, tab, and relay lineage.
@section I. UI
@tabs Merge
@flow TB
@related queue.add-work, processing.start, processing.source-output-collision

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LMerge
@alias merge = Cadroue.Application.LMerge
@alias schedule = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LSchedule

[input] Merge tab requests work <input>
- Receive priority, ordered groups, output preset, tab identity, and relay routing @ ui.LMergeDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build group work <decision>
- Remove missing sources, resolve cohort lineage, and create names unique within this merge batch without checking every source path @ merge.LMergeItemsCreate(...)
? "No surviving group produces work" > rejected
? "One or more groups produce work" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Add every merge item with relay target and source lineage @ schedule.LScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the number of queued groups @ ui.LMergeDescribe(...)
> result

[result] Merge groups queued <output>
= Each surviving group appears as one pending merge job with its order preserved.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No merge work record is added.
